{"id": "195802", "revid": "2217354", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=195802", "title": "Canning", "text": "Canning (\u0995\u09cd\u09af\u09be\u09a8\u09bf\u0982 \"Ky\u0101ni\u1e41\") is a small town in the South 24 Parganas district of West Bengal. It is known as the \"Gateway of the Sundarbans\", as many people reach Canning on their wat to the mangroves."}
